\c 2
\p
\s Ruth 2:Ruth Meets Boaz
\v 1-13 Great Overplanting for Bulbs
Quick to fill in, forms a dense mat of twisty green foliage. Mini orchid-like purple flowers have three-fingered petals with one curving upwards. Sports a central leopard spotted highlight. Will tolerate some foot traffic. Our plant spacing recommendations are based on how quickly groundcovers will spread in their first season of growth.
\p
\v 14-22 This is a transcription of the second passage
